---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy — UK Calculator" 
  description="Read our Privacy Policy to understand how UK Calculator protects your data and ensures 100% client-side privacy for all calculations."
>
  <div class="crumb" style="padding: 16px 48px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
    <a href="/" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
    <span style="margin: 0 6px;">›</span>
    <span style="color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600;">Privacy Policy</span>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 32px auto 80px; padding: 0 24px;">
    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 48px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);">
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 28px;">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        At <strong>UK Calculator</strong>, we believe that your financial and personal data belongs strictly to you. This Privacy Policy outlines our commitment to transparency, data protection, and privacy.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">1. Client-Side Calculation Privacy</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        All calculations performed on UK Calculator are executed locally in your web browser. Any numbers, income figures, mileage data, or parameters you input into our calculators are processed on your device and are <strong>never sent to, stored on, or processed by our servers</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">2. Data Collection & Analytics</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        We do not require user accounts or registration. We collect minimal, anonymized website usage statistics (such as page views and general browser type) solely to improve site performance and ensure reliability.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">3. Cookies</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        We may use essential session cookies or local storage strictly to remember your UI preferences (such as selected region or collapsed category sections). We do not use intrusive tracking cookies.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">4. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Our site may include links to official UK Government and statutory sources (e.g. GOV.UK, HMRC). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external websites.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px;">5. Contacting Us</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 0;">
        If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please visit our <a href="/contact/" style="color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600;">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
